|---|---|---|
| Kafka | STEP 1 tail → STEP 5.5 → STEP 7 → STEP 11 | `kafka_url` |
| Auth | STEP 4 + STEP 5 | `auth.method` |
| Pagination | Always rendered in STEP 5 | `pagination_style`/`pagination_default_limit` |
| Linting | STEP 10.5 | `linting_tool` |
