description: Run a generated project's install/lint/test/build steps inside a minimal, disposable Docker container matched to its tech stack, instead of requiring that stack's language runtime on the host OS. Use whenever the AI SDLC's linting, testing, or fix-loop steps need a runtime (Python, Node.js, Java) that may not be installed on the host.
